$ nexoctl cache policy ls mem
NAME                 TYPE     TTL        TTL MAX    COMMENT
aggressive           built-in 1d         30d        Long lifetimes (1d, at least 1h, at most 30d).
disabled             built-in 1h0m0s     7d         No caching: every request is served by the origin.
immutable-assets     built-in 365d       365d       Versioned assets: one year in cache and in the browsers.
respect-origin       built-in 0s         365d       Only the lifetime the objects state.
standard             built-in 1h0m0s     7d         Default: 1h fresh (bounded to 7d), the Cache-Control of the objects respected.

$ nexoctl cache policy create mem short --ttl-default 10m --ttl-max 1d --browser-cache-control public, max-age=600 --query allowlist:v,lang --key-header Accept-Language --stale-while-revalidate 1m --comment ten minutes
